{"title": "Murderous Sight", "pageid": 28351, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Murderous_Sight", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Murderous Sight</b> is a passive feature that lets the wearer see in the dark and move earlier during combat.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can see in the dark up to 3 m (10 ft). In addition, you gain a +2 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/25px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/38px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/50px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Initiative\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/25px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl\" title=\"Assassin of Bhaal Cowl\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Assassin_of_Bhaal_Cowl\" title=\"Assassin of Bhaal Cowl\">Assassin of Bhaal Cowl</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The stated Darkvision range of 3 m (10 ft) is incorrect. The <code>DarkvisionRange(3)</code> boost from this passive adds to the <code>MinimumDetectionRange</code> value of <code>2</code> found on all characters, effectively providing a Darkvision range of 5 m (17 ft).</li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a> up to 3 m (10 ft). +2 to <a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200807\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1091/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9522/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3417/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0